# Timezone — AEST

For this trunk, all dates and times are **AEST (Australian Eastern Standard Time,
UTC+10)** unless explicitly stated otherwise.

- Write times in AEST. When a time is anchored to another zone (e.g. Product
  Hunt resets at midnight US Pacific), **convert to AEST** and show it, keeping
  the source zone in parentheses for reference.
- Label times with `AEST` so there's no ambiguity.
- Note: this repo uses AEST year-round for simplicity. Sydney observes daylight
  time (AEDT, UTC+11) Oct–Apr — only switch to AEDT if the user asks for it.
